{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22925","headline":"元九以绿丝布白轻褣见寄制成衣服以诗报知 · 白居易","name":"元九以绿丝布白轻褣见寄制成衣服以诗报知","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿丝文布素轻褣，珍重京华手自封。\n贫友远劳君寄附，病妻亲爲我裁缝。\n袴花白似秋云薄，衫色青於春草浓。\n欲着却休知不称，折腰无复旧形容。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}